# ch02-ex2E-q1

Question: Solve, giving your answers correct to 3 significant figures.

**a** $5^{x}=18$

**b** $2^{x}=35$

**c** $3^{2 x}=8$

---

**a**

Take logs of both sides:

$$
\begin{aligned}
\log 5^{x} & =\log 18 \\
x \log 5 & =\log 18 \\
x & =\frac{\log 18}{\log 5}
\end{aligned}
$$

So $x=1.80$ to 3 significant figures.
